WEBVTT

00:00:00.585 --> 00:00:02.452
.. ⟨iz⟩ mir zenen dokh geblibn kinder,

00:00:02.627 --> 00:00:05.062
un az zey hobn tsurikgeforn, hot,

00:00:05.062 --> 00:00:06.891
in, in Nyu-York

00:00:06.964 --> 00:00:09.219
hot gelebt a shvester

00:00:09.225 --> 00:00:12.611
fun mayn tate mitn man. zey hobn keyn kinder nisht gehat.

00:00:12.668 --> 00:00:14.276
zey hobn gevust

00:00:14.276 --> 00:00:16.697
az der tate iz nisht tsurikgekumen funem krig,

00:00:16.697 --> 00:00:19.681
hobn zey durkh Shveytsaryen, durkhn Roytn Kreyts,

00:00:20.093 --> 00:00:21.470
undz getrofn

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:25.790
un hobn undz geshribn aheym in Kosmatsh, in dorf,

00:00:25.864 --> 00:00:30.465
az in Milnitse iz alts vos s'iz geblibn funem tate's tsad,

00:00:30.538 --> 00:00:33.941
iz gevezn a sakh kinder, hot men alts ibergelozt farn tate,

00:00:33.981 --> 00:00:37.265
far di kinder, vayl der tate iz nisht tsurikgekumen fun der milkhome.

00:00:38.031 --> 00:00:42.920
un, mir hobn genemen⟨, un z-⟩ mir zoln zikh bamien

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:45.621
tsu kumen ahin vu der tate iz geboyrn gevorn,

00:00:45.621 --> 00:00:49.466
trots dem vos mir hobn gehat zeyer ⟨a,⟩ mir zenen geven zeyer raykh in dorf oykh.

00:00:49.523 --> 00:00:52.290
kimat ale felder in dorf zenen geven undzere,

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:56.280
un a polonine. a polonine iz a groyse

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:59.543
vald, vu s'iz do gl- glaykhe pletser oykhet,

00:00:59.543 --> 00:01:02.867
un dort kenen a gants yor beheymes un ferd

00:01:02.867 --> 00:01:04.015
pasen zikh.

00:01:04.015 --> 00:01:06.999
flegn di goyim undz tsoln gelt un ahin

00:01:07.005 --> 00:01:10.222
in, in, vesne aroyftraybn

00:01:10.262 --> 00:01:14.460
di beheymes un ale, un dortn makhn puter un brindze

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:17.287
un kez, ⟨un m-⟩ firn es mit di ferd farkoyfn,

00:01:17.287 --> 00:01:18.814
un undz fleg men tsoln derfar.

00:01:18.814 --> 00:01:22.777
ABER trots dem hobn mir bashlosn tsu forn ahin vu der tate iz geboyrn gevorn.

00:01:22.986 --> 00:01:26.931
vi azoy m'hot getribn di beheymes keyn Kolomey tsu der stantsye

00:01:26.931 --> 00:01:28.768
gedenk ikh nisht; kh'bin geven a kind.

00:01:28.808 --> 00:01:32.902
ABER m'hot genemen a groysn vagon, a PUL'MAN fun zekhtsik ton,

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:36.490
di groyse, di, vos me firt, beheymes,

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:39.047
un mir zenen arayngegangen oykhet ahin

00:01:39.047 --> 00:01:42.672
mit di finef beheymes. dos iz gevezn undzer farmegn fun dortn.

00:01:42.814 --> 00:01:44.647
az ze'mir gekumen tsu geyn

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:48.472
di tsvey hundert fuftsik kilometer, farshidene stantsyes,

00:01:48.472 --> 00:01:52.894
iz di letste stantsye fun dem shtetele Milnits IVANE-PUSTE.

00:01:52.894 --> 00:01:55.448
dos iz dray kilometer fun dem shtetl.

00:01:55.588 --> 00:01:59.598
hot men mir g- genemen, ale beheymes tsuzamengebunen mit a shtrik,

00:01:59.638 --> 00:02:02.870
un m'hot gezogt mir... ikh bin shoyn a yingl fun akht yor...

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:07.259
ikh zol zey firn. UNK un zey zenen mit a fur avekgeforn aheym.

00:02:07.401 --> 00:02:10.283
derfar dos s'iz gevezn shtark heys

00:02:10.283 --> 00:02:14.430
hobn di beheymes oysge- zikh, ge-, ts- shtark tselofn.

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:16.670
ikh hob nisht gevolt oplozn dem shtrik,

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:20.430
bin ikh gefloygn tsishn di beymer un m'hot mikh getrofn lign ful in blut.

00:02:20.783 --> 00:02:23.629
un dernokh hot men shoyn gebrakht di beheymes un mikh aheym,

00:02:23.702 --> 00:02:26.784
un ze'mir gekumen tsu geyn ahin vu s'hobn gelebt,

00:02:26.858 --> 00:02:30.010
 ⟨t-⟩ tsvey brider dem tatn's,

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:32.423
 a shvester dem tatn's,

00:02:32.423 --> 00:02:38.320
un zeyere kinder, ⟨un, un in⟩ di nentste derfer, ot di ale, di gantse mishpokhe Mentsher.

00:02:38.417 --> 00:02:40.930
un, fun, di beheymes

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:44.792
zenen gevezn z- zeyer fun a guter rase, Tiroler rase.

00:02:44.792 --> 00:02:47.484
Tirol iz a gegnt vu s'iz gevezn

00:02:47.484 --> 00:02:49.540
gute beheymes. zey flegn gebn

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:53.581
zeks un tsvontsik liter. m'hot in ergets nit geshribn in keyn shum tsaytung vegn dem.

00:02:53.858 --> 00:02:57.530
mir hobn di ale beheymes gegebn di, mishpokhe,

00:02:57.621 --> 00:03:01.288
un fun densmolt on fleg men far a kelbele gebn undz gelt

00:03:01.288 --> 00:03:04.162
mer vi far a beheyme, derfar vos s'iz a gute rase.

00:03:04.557 --> 00:03:08.162
un, mir hobn dokh nisht gekent zikh farnemen mit undzer virtshaft,

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:11.818
iz mir hobn, hobn gehat ⟨dem,⟩ dem tate's

00:03:11.818 --> 00:03:13.409
shvester's a zun,

00:03:13.618 --> 00:03:16.840
D-, DAVID, iz geven a fotograf,

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:21.890
nor er hot lib gehat, v- virtshaft, land-virtshaft,

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:24.614
fleg er b- bay undz onfirn dem gantsn.

00:03:24.857 --> 00:03:29.690
un er fleg zeyer, g- avekgebn undzere felder Ukrayner,

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:32.017
un zey flegn gebn fuftsik protsent

00:03:32.017 --> 00:03:35.283
fun dem, vos s'iz ge-, vos s'iz geven funem feld

00:03:35.283 --> 00:03:37.772
flegn zey nemen zikh, un fuftsik undz, nor

00:03:37.772 --> 00:03:39.390
g- glat aheymgebrakht.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:44.207
un a teyl hobn mir aleyn baarbet oykh. lebn der shtub iz geven a groyser gortn,

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:47.601
un s'iz geven a s- groyse sades. flegn kumen

00:03:47.601 --> 00:03:50.501
yidn fun Varshe, fun Lemberik un aynkoyfn

00:03:50.676 --> 00:03:52.335
oyf di beymer glaykh:

00:03:52.335 --> 00:03:54.551
vifl s'vet zayn, flegn zey batsoln.

00:03:54.793 --> 00:03:58.297
un dernokh mit vagonen flegn zey es oplifern; mir flegn zey gebn.

00:03:58.455 --> 00:04:03.025
di felder undzere zenen geven arumgeringlt mit, d- gr-, gre-

00:04:03.025 --> 00:04:06.050
grikhishe nis, di, di groyse nis.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:08.678
ver s'hot gevolt hot ge-... vayl s'iz dokh geven vayt...

00:04:08.678 --> 00:04:11.528
un trots dem flegn mir hobn fertsik, fuftsik zek.

00:04:11.854 --> 00:04:15.124
azoy hobn mir, in, in Milnits

00:04:15.124 --> 00:04:19.458
ze'mir gegangen ale kinder in shul, in der hebreisher shul, Tarbut shul,

00:04:19.498 --> 00:04:22.023
un ikh hob geendikt in Milnits,

00:04:22.131 --> 00:04:24.015
 zibn klasn

00:04:24.156 --> 00:04:25.652
poylishe folkshul,

00:04:26.181 --> 00:04:31.840
un, un, ⟨a,⟩ un glaykhtsaytik mit der poylisher shul,

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:34.733
formitog un nokhmitogs bin ikh gegangen in der hebreisher

00:04:34.733 --> 00:04:36.317
un der yidisher shul.

00:04:36.829 --> 00:04:39.981
in Milnits iz shoyn gevezn yidishe organizatsyes.

00:04:39.981 --> 00:04:43.323
zeyer shta- a shtarke organizatsye, a yugnt-organizatsye

00:04:43.323 --> 00:04:46.600
iz geven Gordonye, un HANOAR HATSIONI.

00:04:46.633 --> 00:04:49.895
keyn linke organizatsyes zenen in M- iz in Milnits nisht gevezn.

00:04:48.535 --> 00:04:49.535
UNK

00:04:49.895 --> 00:04:54.850
di yidn zenen geven meystn teyl Stam Tsienistn un Mizrakhim,

00:04:55.105 --> 00:04:58.187
nor i Stam Tsienistn, i di Mizrakhistn

00:04:58.193 --> 00:05:01.849
zenen gevezn yidn velekhe zey hobn gehaltn fun

00:05:01.888 --> 00:05:04.669
ale minhogim vos yidn darfn,

00:05:04.669 --> 00:05:09.170
darfn zikh firn. un,

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:14.265
s'iz dort gevezn efsher tsvey mol azoy fil yidn vifl in, in dorf Kosmatsh;

00:05:14.265 --> 00:05:15.821
dos iz shoyn geven a shtetele.

00:05:15.844 --> 00:05:19.460
arum dem shtetl iz geven tsvey un draysik derfer leng-oys

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.424
der sovyetisher grenets.

00:05:21.598 --> 00:05:25.071
undzere felder zenen geven zeyer noent fun der sovyetisher grenets,

00:05:25.071 --> 00:05:28.488
ABER i di poyln, i di, i di rusn

00:05:28.488 --> 00:05:30.387
hobn shtark gehit di grenets.

00:05:30.387 --> 00:05:34.504
nor komunistn flegn bavayzn vinter, ven s'iz farfroyrn gevorn dos vaserl,

00:05:34.504 --> 00:05:38.124
flegn bavayzn komunistn, yidn un, nisht-yidn,

00:05:38.124 --> 00:05:41.432
tsu antloyfn keyn Rusland, vayl zey hobn gemeynt az dort iz

00:05:41.432 --> 00:05:45.757
farhanen a glaykh- a glaykh-barekhtikt lebn, a gut lebn,

00:05:45.932 --> 00:05:49.245
un zeyer oft fleg, flegn zey zen

00:05:49.245 --> 00:05:52.307
az s'iz nit azoy vi, vi, vi m'hot geleyent in di bikher,

00:05:52.307 --> 00:05:55.151
vi m'hot geshribn in z- di tsaytungen, in di linke,

00:05:55.151 --> 00:05:59.561
flegn zey veln tsurikloyfn. fleg men zey khapn un shikn oyf yener velt,

00:05:59.584 --> 00:06:04.336
oder me fleg zey gebn, akht, tsen yor ⟨un zey hobn⟩ gearbet ⟨zey⟩ umzist.

00:06:04.697 --> 00:06:08.251
un, kh'hob geendikt di z- di zibn klasn,

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:12.369
hot mayn shvester khasene gehat keyn Kosev, Dine.

00:06:12.949 --> 00:06:17.088
hot zi mikh shoyn mit zikh mitgenemen fun Milnits,

00:06:17.088 --> 00:06:19.591
⟨,⟩ zenen geblibn tsvey shvester dortn,

00:06:19.817 --> 00:06:22.595
un mikh hot zi mitgenemen. ⟨zi hot⟩ gezogt dem shvoger,

00:06:22.703 --> 00:06:24.640
dem man, "vi lang,

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:28.015
biz er vet nisht oysvaksn, nisht khasene hobn, vet er zayn mit mir.

00:06:28.015 --> 00:06:29.160
bist maskem?"

00:06:29.301 --> 00:06:32.079
hot er gezogt, "yo, kh'bin maskem." bin ikh gegangen,

00:06:32.119 --> 00:06:35.673
⟨UNK⟩kh oysgelernt makhn di zakhn mit der han- mit di hent,

00:06:35.882 --> 00:06:37.850
ot o dos o vos se ligt do...

00:06:37.026 --> 00:06:38.026
CARPET.

00:06:38.228 --> 00:06:40.466
NO! dos iz, divan.

00:06:38.797 --> 00:06:39.797
NO?

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:41.130
o.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:43.979
dos o vos se ligt do oyf dr'erd, darf men arbetn

00:06:43.979 --> 00:06:47.658
fir vokhn, tsvey mentshn. fir vokhn!

00:06:47.658 --> 00:06:50.531
derfar vayl dos iz, dos iz UNK

00:06:50.531 --> 00:06:52.822
yedes, kolir

00:06:52.822 --> 00:06:55.215
hengt oyf d- oyfn varstat.

00:06:55.356 --> 00:06:57.184
dos iz mit di hent gemakht!

00:06:57.184 --> 00:06:59.664
un di tsveyte arbet iz geven kilimes.

00:06:59.664 --> 00:07:01.949
dos ⟨iz ts-⟩ oyf tsvey zaytn glaykh,

00:07:01.949 --> 00:07:05.795
un dos iz nor eyn zayt. eyn zayt iz di vol, un azoy hoykh,

00:07:05.802 --> 00:07:07.736
un di tsveyte zayt iz shagat.

00:07:07.843 --> 00:07:11.161
in a kurtser tsayt hob ikh dos oysgelernt un ikh hob zeyer gut fardint.

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:15.708
endlekh, ikh hob gehat khaveyrim

00:07:16.213 --> 00:07:20.071
velekhe zenen gevezn in Stam Khaluts, in Hashomer Hatsair,

00:07:20.632 --> 00:07:26.209
 un bay undz iz gevezn fray yidishe l- literatur:

00:07:26.209 --> 00:07:28.493
vos ver s'hot gevolt hot geleyent.

00:07:28.583 --> 00:07:31.693
nor az me fleg unterrukn literatur...

00:07:31.693 --> 00:07:35.701
meyle, Sholem-Aleykhem, ⟨Yehude-Leyb⟩ Perets, Mendele Moykher-Sforim,

00:07:35.701 --> 00:07:37.659
Khaim-Nakhmen Byalik. dos iz,

00:07:37.659 --> 00:07:40.881
shpetsyel Sholem-Aleykhem, dos iz dos, dos yidishe

00:07:40.881 --> 00:07:44.003
lebn, dos yidishe oremkeyt, dos yidishe shtetele,

00:07:44.003 --> 00:07:45.472
zeyer interesant.

00:07:45.472 --> 00:07:49.839
ABER me fleg, mir, mir hobn ⟨dortn⟩ gelezn Dubnov ⟨m- o-⟩ Dubnov oykhet,

00:07:49.862 --> 00:07:53.006
un m'hot geleyent, HENRI B- BARBUSSE

00:07:53.006 --> 00:07:56.584
un ROMAIN ROLLAND. dos zenen shraybers velekhe hobn geshribn

00:07:56.584 --> 00:08:00.937
un hobn ertsoygn di yugnt in a, in a sotsyalistishn,

00:08:00.937 --> 00:08:04.439
un afile Marks- Marksistishn,

00:08:04.439 --> 00:08:07.153
 o-, onshoyung.

00:08:07.648 --> 00:08:11.282
un, UPTON SINCLAIR, in Amerike,

00:08:11.282 --> 00:08:13.819
un LĀCIS in, ⟨in⟩ Latvye.

00:08:13.875 --> 00:08:18.037
azoy az, az m'hot geleyent in, in Poyln

00:08:18.111 --> 00:08:22.172
"Di, Di Mame" fun Maksim Gorki, "MAT'" MAKSIMA GOR'KOGO,

00:08:22.212 --> 00:08:25.752
hot men gemeynt az s'iz take alts azoy vi se vert do bashribn,

00:08:25.752 --> 00:08:28.072
un m'iz geven farbrent far der zakh.

00:08:28.072 --> 00:08:31.166
⟨,⟩ ABER di grenetsn zenen geven azoy farmakht

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:35.554
az s'iz gevezn emes azoy vi shtolene vent ⟨b-⟩ fun Rusland.

00:08:35.931 --> 00:08:39.269
un di agitatsye iz gevezn zeyer, shtark far zey,

00:08:39.269 --> 00:08:42.945
vayl zey hobn gelifert milyor- milyonen dolar far dem ⟨OPER⟩,

00:08:43.136 --> 00:08:46.787
un di Ukrayner un di polyakim un di yidn,

00:08:46.787 --> 00:08:49.647
ale hobn gegleybt az s'iz bay zey farhanen

00:08:49.647 --> 00:08:54.600
take a glaykh-barekhtikung far ale felker, far ale arbetorer, far ale mentshn,

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:56.127
far ale shprakhn,

00:08:56.127 --> 00:08:58.031
far ale literaturn,

00:08:58.037 --> 00:09:01.527
un, nu, layder, biz nayntsn zibn un draysik

00:09:01.527 --> 00:09:04.792
hobn mir nisht gevust gornisht daytlekh,

00:09:04.792 --> 00:09:07.560
ABER nayntsn zibn un draysik hobn shoyn di

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:10.403
velekhe hobn, farshtanen...

00:09:10.403 --> 00:09:13.218
m'hot gehert radyo fun, fun oysland...

00:09:13.326 --> 00:09:17.322
az s'iz dortn nisht dos vos ⟨se⟩ shraybt in d⟨er⟩ bikher,

00:09:17.322 --> 00:09:22.060
un di mentshn zenen gevorn ibergekert. m'hot ongehoybn, oyfgehert tsu gleybn,

00:09:22.101 --> 00:09:24.558
vayl di poylishe melukhe fleg zeyer,

00:09:24.632 --> 00:09:28.861
 ⟨, f-⟩ zey- zeyer shlekht zikh batsien tsu komunistn.

00:09:28.885 --> 00:09:30.921
s'iz gevezn in Vronki,

00:09:31.011 --> 00:09:33.632
in Pozner gegnt, a tyurme,

00:09:33.632 --> 00:09:36.995
az fun dortn, nokh, nokh a yor tsayt hot men shoyn nisht gezogt

00:09:37.018 --> 00:09:39.183
az me tor shoyn mer nisht zayn keyn komunist.

00:09:39.183 --> 00:09:41.799
dernokh iz geven BEREZA KARTUSK⟨IEJ⟩, vu a mentsh vert,

00:09:41.799 --> 00:09:44.078
vert farshlofn, hot men im gesh⟨nel⟩t in der noz,

00:09:44.078 --> 00:09:46.474
un m'hot im tsvey, dray vokhn nisht gelozt shlofn,

00:09:46.474 --> 00:09:48.448
un hot er, hot er shoyn untergeshribn

00:09:48.448 --> 00:09:50.731
az er vet shoyn keyn mol nisht zayn keyn komunist.

00:09:50.907 --> 00:09:53.848
di poylishe POLIZEI iz gevezn...

00:09:53.848 --> 00:09:56.891
nokh arger zenen geven in Rumenyen di asekurants.

00:09:57.167 --> 00:09:59.962
un, azoy arum,

00:09:59.985 --> 00:10:02.493
di, ⟨Khal- Kh-⟩...

00:10:00.964 --> 00:10:02.572
kh'hob fargesn

00:10:02.572 --> 00:10:06.386
fregn vegn dayn bar-mitsve. vu

00:10:06.386 --> 00:10:07.924
iz es gemakht?

00:10:08.177 --> 00:10:11.955
 mayn bar-mitsve iz gevezn in Kosev...

00:10:11.702 --> 00:10:12.936
baym ⟨kuzin⟩...

00:10:11.955 --> 00:10:13.718
neyn! neyn, neyn. antshuldik.

00:10:13.718 --> 00:10:16.112
di bar-mitsve iz gevezn in Milnitse.

00:10:16.641 --> 00:10:18.559
ah, ikh gedenk nisht.

00:10:19.493 --> 00:10:20.747
ikh gedenk nisht, nor

00:10:20.747 --> 00:10:24.046
di bar-mitsve iz geven in Milnitse, vayl ikh bin avekgeforn fun Milnitse

00:10:24.046 --> 00:10:26.574
in toyznt nayn hundert nayn un tsvontsik.

00:10:26.715 --> 00:10:29.658
un d- biz ikh hob nokh gevoynt in Milnitse,

00:10:29.658 --> 00:10:30.939
hob ikh opgelernt

00:10:30.939 --> 00:10:33.459
nayntsn,

00:10:33.533 --> 00:10:35.586
nayntsn akht un tsvontsik

00:10:35.642 --> 00:10:38.994
un zibn un tsvontsik in Lublin, in der yeshive.

00:10:39.321 --> 00:10:41.427
fun Milnits bin ikh geforn in der yeshive,

00:10:41.427 --> 00:10:43.984
un fun der yeshive bin ikh tsurikgekumen keyn Milnits.

00:10:43.984 --> 00:10:47.241
in nayntsn nayn un tsvontsik, az di shvester hot khasene gehat keyn Kosev,

00:10:47.241 --> 00:10:50.571
bin ikh shoyn avekgeforn keyn, mit ir keyn Kosev,

00:10:50.593 --> 00:10:53.877
un mir zenen ale geforn. nokh der khasene zenen zey tsurikgeforn,

00:10:54.087 --> 00:10:57.987
un zey hobn gehat, fun vos tsu lebn. zey hobn gehat a sakh feld...

00:10:56.736 --> 00:10:58.775
zey hobn gehat groysn nadn?

00:10:58.660 --> 00:10:59.447
ha?

00:10:58.775 --> 00:11:00.983
zey hobn gehat groysn nadn?

00:11:00.988 --> 00:11:03.682
 UNK s'iz geven a ⟨z-⟩ interesante zakh:

00:11:03.975 --> 00:11:06.655
der, Dintsye hot khasene gehat,

00:11:06.655 --> 00:11:08.402
hot zi keyn nadn nisht gegebn,

00:11:08.402 --> 00:11:11.271
un er hot gearbet baym foter, in a STORE,

00:11:11.271 --> 00:11:13.819
un er hot gegebn zeyer veynik gelt oyf tsu lebn,

00:11:13.819 --> 00:11:18.195
nor er hot shtark, der foter fun, mayn shvoger hot ⟨sh⟩tark lib gehat mayn shvester.

00:11:18.319 --> 00:11:21.316
nor er hot nisht gekent gebn; ⟨s'iz⟩ in a kleyn shtetl.

00:11:21.627 --> 00:11:25.401
hobn mir gemakht a, a, a, ⟨dos⟩, a miting

00:11:25.643 --> 00:11:26.987
in Milnitse

00:11:27.364 --> 00:11:31.323
un ho'mir bashlosn az me ken farkoyfn fir yokh feld,

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:33.635
vet zayn toyznt finef hundert DOLLAR.

00:11:33.962 --> 00:11:37.533
vos darf'mir... ho'mir gehat efsher akhtsik yokh feld. vos darf'mir azoy fil feld?

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:39.660
ho'mir farkoyft fir tsi finef yokh,

00:11:39.885 --> 00:11:44.219
⟨d-⟩ ikh gedenk nisht, oder tsvey toyznt DOLLAR, oder kimat azoy fil.

00:11:44.219 --> 00:11:48.049
iz hot es di, di, di eltste, di Roze

00:11:48.049 --> 00:11:52.471
gefirt bahaltn v⟨u⟩ a f- a froy bahalt ot do o dos gelt,

00:11:52.471 --> 00:11:55.117
un ze'mir geforn nisht mitn P-, mitn tsug,

00:11:55.191 --> 00:11:56.619
mitn SUBWAY,

00:11:56.676 --> 00:11:59.387
di dray hundert kilometer, mit a fyaker,

00:11:59.545 --> 00:12:01.727
⟨zol⟩, me zol nisht oysgebn keyn gelt.

00:12:01.727 --> 00:12:03.632
ze'mir gekumen tsu geyn

00:12:03.632 --> 00:12:06.829
un di sh- di Dintsye hot undz derzen, hot zi zikh shtark derfreyt,

00:12:07.071 --> 00:12:10.772
un mir hobn shtilerheyt, ⟨zenen⟩ gekumen, geshmuest,

00:12:10.772 --> 00:12:13.506
un dernokh hot Roze gezogt, "itstert o,

00:12:13.506 --> 00:12:17.159
l- liber Hersh..." der Hersh iz geven, Tsvi,

00:12:17.159 --> 00:12:18.219
der shvoger...

00:12:18.259 --> 00:12:21.746
"azoy vi du host genemen undzer shvester on nadn, ho'mir dir gebrakht nadn."

00:12:22.157 --> 00:12:26.285
far dem gelt vos mir hobn gebrakht hot er geefnt zeyer a groysn STORE

00:12:26.292 --> 00:12:29.087
hartvarn, dos ⟨vos s'iz baym⟩ foter gevezn.

00:12:29.194 --> 00:12:33.406
shoyn nisht nor a groysn: er hot farkoyft oyf a sakh kleyne gevelbn.

00:12:33.649 --> 00:12:37.305
un dos iz gevezn biz toyznt nayn hundert nayn un draysik.

00:12:37.345 --> 00:12:39.296
bist gegangen in armey?

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.721
yo. in, in armey bin ikh gevezn

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:46.806
in, toyznt nayn hundert draysik

00:12:47.065 --> 00:12:51.294
un eyn un draysik. ⟨un⟩ ikh hob gedarft dinen, merer,

00:12:51.317 --> 00:12:53.043
ober ikh bin krank gevorn,

00:12:53.043 --> 00:12:54.529
kh'hob zikh farkilt tsi vos,

00:12:54.529 --> 00:12:56.897
hot mikh, di komisye bafrayt.

00:12:56.616 --> 00:12:58.854
in poylisher armey, oder...?

00:12:57.898 --> 00:13:01.468
in poylisher armey, avade. in artilerye hob ikh gedint.

00:13:01.695 --> 00:13:02.701
⟨Pilsudski⟩

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:06.240
 P-, neyn, Pilsudski iz shoyn nisht geven. densmolt iz shoyn gevezn...

00:13:03.602 --> 00:13:04.602
tsayt?

00:13:04.955 --> 00:13:05.708
NO?

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:08.946
Pilsudski iz gevezn az Poyln iz antshtanen,

00:13:08.985 --> 00:13:10.548
er hot gehat a shtarke hant.

00:13:10.572 --> 00:13:14.964
bikhlal iz er a mol geven a sotsyalist un hot aroysgegebn a sotsyalistishe tsaytung,

00:13:14.964 --> 00:13:17.714
nor az er hot genemen di makht iz er gevezn

00:13:17.714 --> 00:13:21.483
a guter diktator. er hot ayngefirt a groyse distsiplin,

00:13:21.642 --> 00:13:25.618
un az s'iz gevorn distsiplin iz er gegangen in, iz er gegangen in demisye.

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:28.430
er hot, er hot geendikt ⟨dizhur⟩irn.

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:32.081
in nayntsn zeks un tsvontsik hot er frish gemakht a putsh.

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:35.746
epes hobn ongehoybn di mentshn tsu tun azoy vi s'iz im gefeln,

00:13:35.746 --> 00:13:38.319
hot er avekgevarfn, avekgevorfn di melukhe

00:13:38.319 --> 00:13:40.656
un iz frish avekgegangen. dernokh iz shoyn gevezn,

00:13:40.656 --> 00:13:44.065
bay ende, ven, di milkhome hot zikh ongehoybn, iz shoyn gevezn

00:13:44.065 --> 00:13:46.504
a profesor MOŚCICKI der prezident,

00:13:46.504 --> 00:13:49.243
un der, oysern-minister iz gevezn BECK.

00:13:49.317 --> 00:13:52.230
un di poylishe armey iz geven zeyer a shtarke armey,

00:13:52.422 --> 00:13:55.183
zeyer distsiplinirt, un m'hot gut gegebn tsu esn,

00:13:55.206 --> 00:13:56.972
nor di yidn zen-...

00:13:55.993 --> 00:13:58.265
gut antisemitizm oykh?

00:13:57.552 --> 00:13:59.419
shtarker antisemitizm.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:00.240
shtark.

00:13:59.492 --> 00:14:01.882
der yidisher zelner hot gekent

00:14:02.142 --> 00:14:04.695
m-, oysfiln dem khoyv vi a zelner

00:14:04.695 --> 00:14:06.298
a sakh beser vi a polyak,

00:14:06.298 --> 00:14:08.665
hot er im geshrign, "⟨ŹLE⟩ UNK JESZCZE RAZ."

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.286
"shlekht! nokh a mol."

00:14:10.596 --> 00:14:12.921
vi azoy er zol ⟨es⟩ nisht makhn, ⟨iz er⟩ gevezn...

00:14:12.921 --> 00:14:16.715
f- di yidn flegn opshnaydn dem finger vos me darf...

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:19.146
az me zol nisht geyn in der poylisher armey.

00:14:19.152 --> 00:14:23.888
yidn flegn geyn akht, nayn monat far dem vos m'hot badarft geyn in der armey,

00:14:23.893 --> 00:14:27.079
gantse nekht arumgeyn, ⟨zenen⟩, zey zoln vern distrofikes,

00:14:27.079 --> 00:14:30.260
me zol zey nemen beshas der milkhome nisht mit gever,

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.869
in a, mit a fur,

00:14:31.977 --> 00:14:33.726
oder bikhlal bafrayen.

00:14:33.765 --> 00:14:36.974
fle- hot men zey gerufn "di plagers"; zey hobn zikh geplagt.

00:14:36.974 --> 00:14:40.031
flegn geyn draysik, fertsik bokhurim gantse nekht;

00:14:40.031 --> 00:14:42.309
zey hobn nisht gegesn, nisht getrunken.

00:14:42.309 --> 00:14:44.417
az zey zenen gekumen tsu der komisye,

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:47.141
hobn di polyakim gevust: "a! host zikh geplagt."

00:14:47.552 --> 00:14:51.303
nu, nor zey hobn, zey zoln nisht dinen. nu, ABER

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:56.485
di meystn teyl di vos zenen gevorn alt dem, dem yor vos me darf geyn in der armey

00:14:56.485 --> 00:14:57.992
iz gegangen in der armey.

00:14:58.504 --> 00:15:01.080
nor der antisemitizm iz geven zeyer groys.

00:15:01.525 --> 00:15:06.594
bikhlal, di, di, di polyakim

00:15:06.638 --> 00:15:09.922
zenen vegn dem gevezn,...

00:15:10.435 --> 00:15:14.361
beshas ven s'iz gekumen dos g- di, di groyse katastrofe,

00:15:14.451 --> 00:15:16.487
di okupatsye funem daytsh,

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:20.722
zenen zey gevezn, i di Ukrayner, i di polyakim,

00:15:20.762 --> 00:15:22.156
kimat glaykh

00:15:22.416 --> 00:15:25.720
ve⟨gn, ⟩, in, in, vos s'handlt zikh derin,

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:27.591
vegn umbrengen di yidn.

00:15:28.204 --> 00:15:30.729
in, in Kosev,

00:15:32.113 --> 00:15:35.775
 iz gevezn kimat a helft, zeks toyznt yidn.

00:15:36.827 --> 00:15:40.047
un, ikh hob shoyn gezogt, a lange gas,

00:15:40.047 --> 00:15:43.537
un oyf beyde zaytn kimat ale hiltserne b- gebaydes,

00:15:43.594 --> 00:15:47.182
un di yidn hobn zikh farnemen mit TEPPICHer un di kilimes.

00:15:47.543 --> 00:15:50.374
a sakh, di, a sakh yidishe arbetorer.

00:15:49.855 --> 00:15:50.855
⟨⟩.

00:15:50.374 --> 00:15:52.949
fuftsik protsent hobn gearbet; m'hot gut fardint.

00:15:52.949 --> 00:15:55.125
ABER s'iz a shedlekhe arbet, vayl di ⟨v-,⟩

00:15:55.125 --> 00:15:57.757
di osnove iz zeyer sh- ongetsoygn,

00:15:57.757 --> 00:16:00.592
iz dos, di f- di feder fun di volene,

00:16:00.592 --> 00:16:02.977
di farbn faln arop, di ⟨mokh⟩,

00:16:03.118 --> 00:16:05.233
un dos iz shedlekh far der lung.

00:16:05.233 --> 00:16:08.102
mentshn vos zey arbetn zeyer a sakh yorn zenen,

00:16:08.102 --> 00:16:10.133
kenen vern krank mit di lungen.

00:16:10.594 --> 00:16:13.476
iz, hob ⟨ikh zikh⟩ dermit farnemen.

00:16:13.476 --> 00:16:19.042
nu, es iz geven a shtetl, geven groyse gevelbn, vayl fun ale arumike gevelbn fleg men kumen ahin

00:16:19.099 --> 00:16:22.434
un me fleg, koyfn bay zey ales dos.

00:16:22.255 --> 00:16:27.508
yetst lomir geyn tsum toyznt nayn hundert

00:16:27.508 --> 00:16:30.478
zeks un draytsik, un dan

00:16:30.478 --> 00:16:32.812
bizn milkhome-yorn.

00:16:32.101 --> 00:16:33.740
⟨biz di milkhome-⟩yorn?

00:16:33.308 --> 00:16:34.179
YEAH.

00:16:34.101 --> 00:16:40.126
azoy vi mayn shvoger hot gehat a groysn, aynflus,

00:16:40.126 --> 00:16:42.076
oyf a general

00:16:42.167 --> 00:16:44.822
v- vays-gvardeyer, vos fun der rusisher

00:16:44.822 --> 00:16:47.088
tsarisher armey iz geblibn in Poyln,

00:16:47.331 --> 00:16:51.105
hot er, mit zeks toyznt rusishe soldatn

00:16:51.128 --> 00:16:53.285
di ⟨pushtshe BELOVEZHSKAYA⟩...

00:16:53.285 --> 00:16:57.385
dos iz a groys, rizik vald... hobn zey dos gehakt bay, far der melukhe.

00:16:57.385 --> 00:17:00.785
er hot fardint a sakh gelt un er hot geefnt aza min o

00:17:00.785 --> 00:17:04.469
zakh vos, hunderter mentshn hobn gemakht di TEPPICHer.

00:17:04.712 --> 00:17:07.911
iz, azoy vi ikh hob dos gekent makhn

00:17:07.911 --> 00:17:10.759
un er hot badarft hobn a mentsh, er zol forn in Poyln,

00:17:10.759 --> 00:17:13.273
in Rumenyen, Tshekhoslovakay kontrolirn

00:17:13.273 --> 00:17:16.822
di mentshn vos zey gibn dos avek oyf finef yor oystsutsoln.

00:17:16.963 --> 00:17:19.930
nor kedey ot di mentshn vos UNK koyfn dos

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:22.697
zoln zayn ts-, zoln gut tsoln,

00:17:22.697 --> 00:17:25.591
az zey zoln nisht trinken, keyn vodke oder,

00:17:25.591 --> 00:17:27.701
oder, nisht veln tsoln,

00:17:27.701 --> 00:17:29.951
hot men badarft informatsye hobn.

00:17:30.177 --> 00:17:32.365
deroyf bin ikh geven eyner,

00:17:32.488 --> 00:17:35.910
 a nemen, a fartroyungs-mentsh,

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:39.285
vos ikh fleg in ale shtet kontrolirn di agentn

00:17:39.285 --> 00:17:43.240
un di mentshn velekhe zey hobn zikh farnemen mit farkoyfn...

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:45.256
dos iz zeyer tayer gevezn.

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:48.373
tsum bayshpil, azelekhe vi der o, dray kvadrat meter,

00:17:48.373 --> 00:17:51.073
hot gekent kostn, f- zeks, zibn,

00:17:51.073 --> 00:17:53.967
 SUITS gute hot men gekent koyfn derfar.

00:17:53.967 --> 00:17:56.361
a groyser prayz⟨; dos iz⟩ hant-ARBEIT.

00:17:56.653 --> 00:17:59.735
fleg⟨ me⟩n haltn shpetsyel polyakim vos zey flegn geyn,

00:17:59.843 --> 00:18:02.452
 zogn az s'iz a poylishe firme,

00:18:03.133 --> 00:18:07.323
vayl der, der Kordetski, der general der rusisher, hot gehat

00:18:07.323 --> 00:18:10.101
a shutef Hilman, Alter Hilman,

00:18:10.101 --> 00:18:12.898
un der Alter Hilman iz geven gut bakant mit mayn shvoger.

00:18:12.904 --> 00:18:16.593
derfar hot er gezogt, me zol mikh nemen. m'hot mir getsolt zeyer a sakh gelt.

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:19.777
un ikh hob gevolt, dos gelt zoln di shvester nemen,

00:18:19.777 --> 00:18:23.175
un zey hobn gezogt, "neyn, Shimshele." zey zenen shoyn geven aleyn raykh,

00:18:23.434 --> 00:18:26.148
vayl Roze hot gehat oykhet aza fabrik fun dem,

00:18:26.148 --> 00:18:29.041
Dintsye hot gehat a groys, gevelb vos,

00:18:29.041 --> 00:18:31.894
me fleg nokh gebn oyf kleyne gevelber dos, mitn shvoger,

00:18:31.894 --> 00:18:35.640
un Ester iz geblibn eyne aleyn in Milnits mitn gantsn farmegn,

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:39.476
un dertsu iz er nokh gevezn zeyer a guter ZUSCHNEIDER, a shnayder.

00:18:39.718 --> 00:18:44.449
derfar iz im gelungen, ven di daytshn zenen gekumen in Milnitse

00:18:44.449 --> 00:18:49.891
iz im gelungen tsu zayn der letster, hot men im, im un di froy un di kinder geharget.

00:18:49.891 --> 00:18:52.945
er fleg neyen di daytshe ofitsirn

00:18:52.945 --> 00:18:55.861
SUITS, hobn zey im ibergelozt biz ende.

00:18:55.969 --> 00:18:59.822
un der, der man fun mayn shvester, der shvoger,

00:18:59.822 --> 00:19:03.320
fleg trogn in geto arayn di brider funem tate,

00:19:03.343 --> 00:19:05.396
 di kuzens

00:19:05.875 --> 00:19:09.230
⟨SMOTING⟩. zey hobn ge- ongehoybn tsu reykhern far tsores.

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:11.617
er hot alts getun, er hot zey geholfn.

00:19:11.617 --> 00:19:15.622
un di mishpokhe iz geven gegn im, az mayn shvester zol khasene hobn mit a shnayder,

00:19:15.797 --> 00:19:19.667
vayl di mishpokhe Mentsher iz gevezn zeyer groy- a groyse mishpokhe:

00:19:19.667 --> 00:19:22.591
"vi azoy ken zayn, a shnayder zol zayn bay undz in der mishpokhe?"

00:19:22.682 --> 00:19:25.168
ABER er iz geven zeyer a laytisher mentsh,

00:19:25.168 --> 00:19:26.779
un mir hobn ⟨d-⟩ bashlosn,

00:19:26.779 --> 00:19:30.405
Dintsye, Roze un ikh, az zi zol mit im khasene hobn;

00:19:30.405 --> 00:19:32.480
er iz geven zeyer a fayner bokher.

00:19:32.757 --> 00:19:36.027
zenen mir geven di revolutsyonern vos mir hobn gebrakht dertsu,

00:19:36.027 --> 00:19:39.537
vos er hot take kha-... ABER er iz take geven a guter man far ir

00:19:39.537 --> 00:19:41.621
un zeyer geven gut far undz.

00:19:41.621 --> 00:19:44.540
azoy arum, er hot gevizn der mishpokhe,

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:45.966
vos zey hobn im nisht gevolt,

00:19:45.966 --> 00:19:48.663
az er iz, bay dem letstn moment hot er zey geholfn.

00:19:48.703 --> 00:19:51.127
mayn kuzen in Erets-Yisroel

00:19:51.437 --> 00:19:53.720
iz, gekumen

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:55.374
keyn, oykh,

00:19:55.374 --> 00:19:58.401
hot oykh gebrakht fun BRIKHA akhtsik kinder

00:19:58.643 --> 00:20:01.100
in, fun, in CYPR.

00:20:01.107 --> 00:20:05.265
ven nayntsn akht un fertsik UNK Erets-Yisroel iz gevorn fray,

00:20:05.265 --> 00:20:07.035
hot er in nomen fun

00:20:07.035 --> 00:20:08.857
BEN-GURION gemoldn

00:20:08.857 --> 00:20:11.276
az Erets-Yisroel iz a fray land.

00:20:11.502 --> 00:20:14.569
ober di froy hot im gezogt, "in Erets-Yisroel

00:20:14.569 --> 00:20:17.874
vestu mer zikh mit politik nisht farnemen. du vest zayn mayn man,

00:20:18.066 --> 00:20:20.138
un mer vestu nisht zayn

00:20:20.138 --> 00:20:22.278
in HANHAGA RASHIT fun Gordonye.

00:20:22.335 --> 00:20:25.383
vest zayn mayn man." un er iz bizn hayntikn tog,

00:20:25.575 --> 00:20:27.673
iz er, hot er a klinik,

00:20:27.673 --> 00:20:30.204
un zeks un tsvontsik yor hot er gearbet

00:20:30.204 --> 00:20:31.951
in Erets-Yisroel armey

00:20:31.951 --> 00:20:36.943
als tekhniker un dokter ⟨medi-⟩ fun, ts- tson-dokter, dentist.

00:20:35.413 --> 00:20:37.752
un zayn, zayn nomen?

00:20:37.506 --> 00:20:39.772
zayn nomen iz Shrage Mentsher.

00:20:39.772 --> 00:20:43.693
er voynt in Khayfe, in, ⟨DISRAELI⟩, in Karmel.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:47.118
zayne tsvey eyniklekh, eyner iz in di GOLAN,

00:20:47.412 --> 00:20:50.201
in der armey, un der tsveyter iz a prokuror

00:20:50.201 --> 00:20:53.227
in der armey. er hot geendikt a YURIDICHESKIY FAKUL'TET.

00:20:53.284 --> 00:20:54.512
di tokhter

00:20:54.512 --> 00:20:58.318
un, mitn, man, mayn kuzen's tokhter

00:20:58.318 --> 00:21:01.867
un der man, dem man's foter hot gehat a krume noz.

00:21:02.059 --> 00:21:04.326
ikh hob gemakht im di krume noz.

00:21:04.326 --> 00:21:08.443
er iz geven in Gordonye, un ikh bin shoyn geven ⟨a bisl⟩ linker vi Gordonye.

00:21:08.443 --> 00:21:10.085
hob ikh im gegebn a klap,

00:21:10.243 --> 00:21:15.547
un di n- hob im a bisl oysge- oysgekrimt di noz. fleg men im rufn "⟨Mesye⟩ Krume Noz".

00:21:15.547 --> 00:21:19.501
un er iz gekumen keyn, Erets-Yisroel in di tsvontsiker yorn.

00:21:19.575 --> 00:21:23.227
er hot khasene gehat mit, oykh mit a meydl undzere a khaverte,

00:21:23.227 --> 00:21:26.280
Golde Lerner, un bay im iz gevezn,

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:29.031
 UNK, der eyntsiker zun,

00:21:29.031 --> 00:21:30.566
vos er hot khasene gehat

00:21:30.566 --> 00:21:32.478
mit der tokhter fun mayn kuzen.

00:21:32.586 --> 00:21:35.080
zi heyst BATYA. er heyst Pinkhes.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:38.908
un az er kumt keyn Amerike vegn, elektronik,

00:21:38.965 --> 00:21:45.236
es vart im op di Amerikaner, ⟨B.B., tsi⟩ vi azoy heysn zey? di shpetsyele,

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:47.272
di shpetsyele makht,

00:21:47.272 --> 00:21:49.691
un me firt im tsurik, vayl in Erets-Yisroel

00:21:49.731 --> 00:21:53.398
arbet er in der amunitsye-industrye,

00:21:53.398 --> 00:21:56.323
un mayn, kuzen veys nisht vos er tut.

00:21:56.751 --> 00:21:59.595
azoy arum az,...

00:21:58.632 --> 00:22:07.126
september toyznt nayn hundert nayn un draytsik, vi alt bistu geven?

00:22:06.977 --> 00:22:11.544
 ikh bin geboyrn nayntsn tsvelef. in nayn un draysik, dos iz,

00:22:11.719 --> 00:22:16.269
 akht ⟨iz⟩ tsvontsik, nayn un tsvontsik...

00:22:16.444 --> 00:22:19.797
iz nayntsn, nayn, nayn un tsvontsik yor. yo.

00:22:20.376 --> 00:22:22.513
oyb ikh bin geboyrn nayntsn tsvelef...

00:22:20.384 --> 00:22:21.595
⟨, OKAY⟩.

00:22:21.853 --> 00:22:23.278
nisht farheyrat?

00:22:23.683 --> 00:22:25.620
NO. neyn, neyn.

00:22:24.565 --> 00:22:25.860
far vos nit?

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:29.567
 ikh hob do gebrakht, ibergelozt a bild fun a meydl,

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:31.709
vos m'hot mir gegebn in Moskve zi.

00:22:32.222 --> 00:22:36.097
 mir k- hobn zikh gekent in Kosev in di yunge yorn,

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:40.012
un mir hobn zikh zeyer shtark lib gehat, shoyn nokh dem ven ikh bin gekumen,

00:22:40.018 --> 00:22:42.054
ikh hob shoyn gearbet un geforn.

00:22:42.583 --> 00:22:45.744
ikh hob shtark lib gehat di kinder fun, i fun Dintsyen,

00:22:45.744 --> 00:22:50.339
i fun Rozen. ikh hob kimat zey ertsoygn mer vi mayn shvester.

00:22:50.633 --> 00:22:53.833
ikh hob zey shtark... az m'hot badarft geyn tsun a dokter, nor mit mir.

00:22:54.312 --> 00:22:57.242
un ikh hob ir gezogt, "⟨Rontsye⟩, vart."

00:22:57.754 --> 00:23:01.126
i-, bay undz iz gevezn azoy ongenemen,

00:23:01.126 --> 00:23:02.594
az du host khasene,

00:23:02.594 --> 00:23:06.236
iz dayn froy dayn mishpokhe, un nisht merer.

00:23:06.765 --> 00:23:09.121
un ikh fleg zikh mit ir trefn,

00:23:09.195 --> 00:23:11.985
un mir zenen geven zeyer, heymish.

00:23:11.985 --> 00:23:14.288
az mir fleg'mir zikh geyn bodn, kedey

00:23:14.288 --> 00:23:17.190
ikh zol zi nisht brengen ⟨tsu ekstaz un⟩ zikh,

00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:20.050
⟨kh'hob mikh⟩ oysgedreyt un ho'mir zikh gebodn tsuzamen.

00:23:20.050 --> 00:23:22.739
ober ikh hob nit erloybt dos vos kh'hob ⟨nit⟩ gekent erloybn.

00:23:23.320 --> 00:23:28.962
un mi- undz ho'mir zikh beyde ts-, GEMEINSAM azoy lib gehat,

00:23:28.962 --> 00:23:31.568
az mir iz geven genug tsu geyn mit ir shpatsirn,

00:23:31.568 --> 00:23:34.479
shmuesn mit ir. zi iz oykh geven in Hashomer Hatsair,

00:23:34.479 --> 00:23:37.657
zeyer a balezene geven, un zi hot gearbet bay di zakhn.

00:23:37.832 --> 00:23:40.492
un ikh hob gehat azoy fil gelt,

00:23:40.515 --> 00:23:42.770
az kh'hob gekent efenen tsen STOREn,

00:23:43.232 --> 00:23:45.150
un ikh hob alts gezogt mayn shvoger,

00:23:45.578 --> 00:23:47.920
"nem mayne tshekn, tu alts dermit!

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:49.352
ikh darf nisht keyn gelt."

00:23:49.729 --> 00:23:54.397
ikh bin geven azoy ertsoygn az, kh'hob gehat alts vos me darf.

00:23:54.505 --> 00:23:57.506
un der, fabr- der, general,

00:23:57.506 --> 00:24:00.772
fun yeder nesie, a khoydesh tsayt fleg ikh kumen aheym,

00:24:00.772 --> 00:24:03.611
hot er gemakht a kostyum, a mantl a prezent.

00:24:03.803 --> 00:24:05.420
fun yeder nesie!

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:07.394
me fleg mikh ontun in a...

00:24:07.394 --> 00:24:09.990
a khaluts tor dokh nisht geyn mit keyn kravat,

00:24:10.030 --> 00:24:13.840
 mit a tseflokhtn hemd. fleg ikh, dortn fleg ikh take yo ontun,

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:16.971
ABER az ikh fleg kumen keyn Kosev in shtetl mit mayne khaveyrim,

00:24:16.971 --> 00:24:18.700
bin ikh gegangen azoy vi zey.

00:24:18.700 --> 00:24:21.417
un ikh fleg brengen farn sport-klub Makabi,

00:24:21.417 --> 00:24:25.683
 dortn, elef por, di sport-zakhn,

00:24:25.683 --> 00:24:27.120
hemdlekh mit di ⟨al-⟩

00:24:27.120 --> 00:24:29.142
⟨az s'⟩zol, ikh bin a guter khaver.

00:24:29.470 --> 00:24:33.092
ABER az kh'hob in, baym rebe in moyer in keler

00:24:33.098 --> 00:24:37.069
a groysn, ayzernem kastn mit, mit a sakh gelt

00:24:37.069 --> 00:24:40.787
hob ikh mikh geshemt afile tsu zogn emetsn, nor ir hob ikh gezogt.

00:24:41.012 --> 00:24:43.363
layder hot zikh ongehoybn di milkhome,

00:24:43.363 --> 00:24:45.219
un zi iz nebekh gefaln

00:24:45.219 --> 00:24:47.284
nisht visndik fun keyn familye-lebn.

00:24:47.796 --> 00:24:51.604
un ven s'hot zikh geendikt di milkhome bin ikh geforn

00:24:51.745 --> 00:24:54.186
fun, ⟨L-,⟩ KRAKÓW

00:24:54.276 --> 00:24:58.962
gevor vern, ongefregt ver, vos, ven. layder iz keyner nisht geblibn.

00:24:59.440 --> 00:25:01.976
un, mir hobn gehat

00:25:01.976 --> 00:25:05.705
azoy fil bakante Ukrayner in Kosev, in der gegnt,

00:25:05.705 --> 00:25:09.974
UNK zenen geven azoy min bafrayndet mit mayn shvoger, mit mayn shvester,

00:25:09.974 --> 00:25:11.924
mitn gevelb, mit mir,

00:25:11.924 --> 00:25:16.430
un keyner hot nisht gekent, nemen khotshbe a kind oyshaltn.

00:25:16.500 --> 00:25:17.810
m'hot nisht genemen.

00:25:18.812 --> 00:25:21.877
layder veys nisht di gantse yidishe velt derfun,

00:25:22.339 --> 00:25:24.628
az arum Kosev iz oykh gevezn

00:25:24.718 --> 00:25:29.335
etlekhe un draysik derfer, biz tsu der grenets fun Tshekhoslovakay, Rumenyen,

00:25:29.427 --> 00:25:33.521
un oykh in yedn dorf, vi in Kosmatsh, iz oykh geven fuftsik, zekhtsik mishpokhes.

00:25:33.628 --> 00:25:37.287
eyn dorf iz geven greser fun ale derfer.

00:25:37.287 --> 00:25:39.208
dos dorf hot geheysn Zhabye.

00:25:39.906 --> 00:25:45.683
UNK vayt bay der grenets, groyse berg, toyznt akht hundert, tsvey toyznt meter di heykh.

00:25:45.812 --> 00:25:48.185
dos dorf hot gehat a teritorye vi Vin,

00:25:48.276 --> 00:25:49.962
di hoypt-shtot fun EstrayCH,

00:25:49.962 --> 00:25:51.673
iz geven azoy groys vi di, dos.

00:25:51.673 --> 00:25:54.137
akht hundert mishpokhes zenen geven in dem dorf,

00:25:54.137 --> 00:25:57.670
un dort iz gevezn zeyer a inteligente yidishe,

00:25:57.670 --> 00:26:01.292
 yugnt, un di, un di, un di, bikhlal di yidn.

00:26:01.292 --> 00:26:04.835
s'iz geven a seminaryum a hebreisher, a gimnazyum iz geven dortn.

00:26:04.835 --> 00:26:06.160
mer vi in Kosev!

00:26:06.160 --> 00:26:07.603
Kosev iz geven

00:26:07.603 --> 00:26:12.506
a shtetl, a rayon, ⟨a, azoy vi,⟩ mer hoypt,

00:26:12.506 --> 00:26:14.632
un Zhabye hot gehat merer

00:26:14.632 --> 00:26:18.512
yidishe organizatsyes, azoy az mir flegn geyn ⟨ahin⟩... s'iz vayt gevezn,

00:26:18.512 --> 00:26:20.538
fertsik kilometer fun Kosev,

00:26:20.538 --> 00:26:22.461
nor mir flegn geyn tsu fus ahin

00:26:22.461 --> 00:26:26.240
zikh trefn mit yener yugnt, un me fleg undz haltn dortn dray, fir teg.

00:26:26.240 --> 00:26:28.820
di gegnt iz ⟨dokh⟩ geven azoy sheyn

00:26:29.130 --> 00:26:32.887
az me ⟨k-⟩ s'iz gor shver tsu bashraybn, di sheyne gegnt,

00:26:32.961 --> 00:26:35.840
vi azoy sheyn di yidn hobn farbrakht dortn di tsayt.

00:26:35.982 --> 00:26:39.283
in, Zhabye iz geven a guter dramatisher krayz.

00:26:39.542 --> 00:26:41.555
s'iz geven a dramatisher krayz KEDEM,

00:26:41.555 --> 00:26:44.328
un s'iz geven a yidisher dramatisher krayz Anski.

00:26:44.335 --> 00:26:47.824
in Kosev iz geven a dramatisher krayz, hobn zey geshtelt "Dem Dibek",

00:26:47.824 --> 00:26:50.111
"Dem Toybn" fun Dovid Bergelson

00:26:50.111 --> 00:26:54.499
beser vi a, an, a profesyonaler, dramatisher krayz.

00:26:54.499 --> 00:26:57.705
es iz geven in Kosev an advokat Frenkl,

00:26:57.705 --> 00:27:00.084
hot er gehat tsvey tekhter un a zun.

00:27:00.084 --> 00:27:05.355
Daniel Frenkl iz⟨... er iz⟩ geshtorbn bay etlekhe un draysik yor, fun tshekhotke...

00:27:05.445 --> 00:27:10.025
er hot gevolt inem dramatishn krayz fun yedn eynem vos er hot gornisht gekent zayn keyn artist,

00:27:10.025 --> 00:27:13.302
hot er fun im gevolt makhn an artist. un er iz krank gevorn.

00:27:13.444 --> 00:27:17.876
un az er iz geshtorbn iz ⟨men⟩ gegangen ⟨in⟩ ale derfer⟨, in⟩ ale shtetlekh⟨, zenen⟩ gekumen oyf der levaye.

00:27:17.916 --> 00:27:20.511
er iz geven der onfirer funem dramatishn krayz.

00:27:20.511 --> 00:27:24.409
un fun Stanisloy, fun dem g- gants groysn yidishn teater, Lebtselter

00:27:24.409 --> 00:27:26.282
fleg kumen ⟨zikh⟩ bavundern,

00:27:26.282 --> 00:27:29.522
az Kosev fleg aroysforn ⟨in⟩ andere shtet un vayzn

00:27:29.522 --> 00:27:30.923
yidishe pyeses,

00:27:30.923 --> 00:27:33.536
meystn teyl Anski, krayz.

00:27:33.576 --> 00:27:35.899
un, di Vilner trupe,

00:27:35.922 --> 00:27:40.227
di Vilner trupe, vu s'iz gevezn DIANA Blumenfeld, JONAS TURKÓW,

00:27:40.227 --> 00:27:43.799
Ide KAMIŃSKA, Maryem KAMIŃSKA, di ale artistn,

00:27:43.799 --> 00:27:46.946
flegn mir zey haltn oyf, bay der frisher luft in Kosev

00:27:46.946 --> 00:27:49.291
a gantsn khoydesh, zey zoln zikh opruen,

00:27:49.291 --> 00:27:51.784
un zey flegn undz helfn dem dramatishn krayz

00:27:51.784 --> 00:27:53.611
oyfshteln azelekhe pyeses,

00:27:53.611 --> 00:27:56.193
⟨az⟩ di gantse mentshn flegn kumen

00:27:56.193 --> 00:27:58.961
in teater, un me fleg unterhaltn, me fleg batsoln.

00:27:58.961 --> 00:28:02.294
⟨un der dra-⟩ iz geven a dramatisher krayz a Tsienistisher,

00:28:02.294 --> 00:28:03.889
a Poyale-Tsienistisher,

00:28:03.889 --> 00:28:05.746
un afile a Royter oykhet.

00:28:06.077 --> 00:28:09.277
un ⟨iz⟩, interesant iz dos vos,

00:28:09.402 --> 00:28:13.479
der birger-mayster iz gevezn der eyntsiker in Poyln, dokter Gertner,

00:28:13.485 --> 00:28:15.819
a Stam Tsienist. er iz geven gut,

00:28:15.819 --> 00:28:19.554
i far di polyakim, i far di yidn; far ale iz er geven zeyer gut.

00:28:19.864 --> 00:28:22.828
nor az s'iz gekumen nayntsn nayn un draysik di Sovyetn,

00:28:22.851 --> 00:28:25.843
un m'hot bald gezen az dos iz nisht keyn lebn,

00:28:25.843 --> 00:28:27.637
dos iz nisht keyn virklekhkeyt,

00:28:27.643 --> 00:28:30.151
dos iz nisht keyn reale zakh far mentshn,

00:28:30.175 --> 00:28:32.109
hot der dokter Gertner gezogt

00:28:32.335 --> 00:28:35.906
aza min zakh, az "do vet shoyn mistam zayn Ukrayn."

00:28:36.469 --> 00:28:40.158
vayl s'iz take dort, di hoypt-bafelkerung iz dokh Ukrayner, nisht polyakim.

00:28:40.789 --> 00:28:46.329
derfar, ven in, in Mitl-Azyen iz geven di poylishe armye,

00:28:46.329 --> 00:28:48.495
vos Stalin hot gevolt SIKORSKI,

00:28:48.636 --> 00:28:50.202
vos, un Anders,

00:28:50.202 --> 00:28:54.418
vos Stalin hot gevolt, zey zoln geyn oyf dem front, shlogn zikh,

00:28:54.525 --> 00:28:56.696
hot men SIKORSKIn geharget...

00:28:56.770 --> 00:28:58.766
me zogt, di polyakim aleyn...

00:28:58.766 --> 00:29:02.939
un Anders iz avekgegangen keyn Iran, keyn P- keyn Persyen.

00:29:03.182 --> 00:29:07.513
tsuzamen mit zey, a kapitan fun der poylisher armey iz geven dokter Gertner.

00:29:07.890 --> 00:29:11.934
BEGIN iz oykh geven dort in yener tsayt. ikh bin oykh geven in der armey.

00:29:12.075 --> 00:29:16.653
ABER mir hobn gezen, az s'iz tsugekumen a POLITSEYSKIY, zogt er, "o, Mentsher,

00:29:16.653 --> 00:29:20.265
in Kosev iz er geven a linker. er vet nokh do, makhn dem komunizm."

00:29:20.265 --> 00:29:22.281
ho'mir farshtanen, nisht nor ikh,

00:29:22.281 --> 00:29:25.586
zeks hundert poylishe yidn zenen avek fun der armey

00:29:25.643 --> 00:29:28.286
tsu der rusisher makht ⟨un gezogt,⟩ "tut vos ir vilt,

00:29:28.326 --> 00:29:33.022
nor mir'n mit der armey nisht avekgeyn." mir hobn gekent efsher aribergeyn un kumen keyn Erets-Yisroel,

00:29:33.022 --> 00:29:36.583
ABER m'hot moyre gehat far zey. iz gekumen VANDA VASILEVSKAYA,

00:29:36.583 --> 00:29:38.676
a zhurnalistke fun Lemberik,

00:29:38.676 --> 00:29:41.265
un hot undz avekgefirt keyn BUZULUKI.
